    teacher: "This is a sensitive area, especially in contexts of ethnic conflict or violence. Create a safe and respectful space, avoid generalisations and stereotypes, and do not let discussions become accusations. Allow people to share experiences if they wish. Be aware that some may have lost loved ones in ethnic conflict. Provide pastoral support.",
    assess: "Weekly check: ask learners how the early church dealt with ethnic tension.",
