    apply: "Welcome someone of different social standing this week and spend time with them. Examine your church's practices for hidden favouritism and raise concerns with leaders. Give to a benevolence fund or share resources with someone in need. Memorise James 2:1.",
    activity: "Read James 2:1-9 and discuss with a role-play of welcoming two visitors. Read 1 Corinthians 11:17-22 and discuss. List practical changes. Pray for equality and generosity.",
