    apply: "Affirm someone of the opposite gender and of a different generation for a gift you see in them. Ask an older person to share their story and a younger person to share their perspective. Examine whether any practice in your church dishonours women, men, youth or the elderly. Memorise Galatians 3:28.",
    activity: "Read Galatians 3:26-29, Acts 2:14-18 and Romans 16:1-16. List the people named and their service. Discuss how the church can value all. Pair younger and older learners for conversation. Pray.",
