    prayer: "Thank God for welcoming us. Ask for compassion for strangers. Pray for refugees and migrants and for wise policies.",
    teacher: "Immigration is politically charged; focus on the biblical call to love and hospitality without prescribing particular policies. Be sensitive to learners who are migrants or whose families have been affected by migration. Protect confidentiality, especially around legal status.",
