    sa: ["How should churches welcome strangers and migrants?", ["remember", "welcome", "practical", "belong", "lead", "advocate"], "A good answer says churches remember that we were strangers welcomed by Christ, offer practical help and friendship, make room for newcomers to belong and lead, and advocate for just treatment."],
